@startuml use-case
' Use-case diagram for the web and mobile apps.
' Render at https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml or with the VS Code PlantUML extension.
title Blackjack: Use-Case Diagram
left to right direction

actor Guest
actor Player
actor "Email Service" as Mail <<system>>
Guest <|-- Player

rectangle "Blackjack App (React web + Flutter mobile)" {
  usecase "Register account" as Register
  usecase "Verify email" as Verify
  usecase "Resend verification email" as Resend
  usecase "Log in" as Login
  usecase "Reset forgotten password" as Reset
  usecase "View leaderboard" as Board

  usecase "Play 10-round attempt" as Attempt
  usecase "Play a round" as Round
  usecase "Hit" as Hit
  usecase "Stand" as Stand
  usecase "View my attempts and best score" as History
  usecase "View profile" as Profile
  usecase "Log out" as Logout
}

Guest --> Register
Guest --> Verify
Guest --> Resend
Guest --> Login
Guest --> Reset
Guest --> Board

Player --> Attempt
Player --> History
Player --> Profile
Player --> Logout

Attempt ..> Round : <<include>>
Hit ..> Round : <<extend>>
Stand ..> Round : <<extend>>

Register --> Mail
Resend --> Mail
Reset --> Mail

note right of Login
  Refused until the
  email is verified.
end note
@enduml
